  "name": {
   "zh": "动捕清理 · StableMotion",
   "en": "Mocap Cleanup · StableMotion"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "StableMotion 官方自述：不需要成对的干净数据，从原始动捕数据学会修复损坏的动作，论文里由动作质量标记找出有问题的帧。这张卡交付修好的动作和问题帧曲线。清理好的动作可以原样交付，也可以在「目标角色」里选导入的 FBX / USD 角色重定目标过去。",
   "en": "StableMotion describes itself as learning to repair corrupted motion from raw mocap data without paired clean data; in the paper, motion quality labels find the problem frames. This card delivers the repaired motion and problem-frame curves. The cleaned motion can be delivered as is, or retargeted to an imported FBX / USD character chosen in Target Character."
  },
  "deliverable": "cleanup",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
